Reconstruct Lost Organ.

265
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:18,720
Go on. Open it. Yes, ma 'am.

266
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:28,037
Thank you for fixing it, Mrs. Zerka.

267
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,620
You are most welcome.

268
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,115
Now listen carefully.

269
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:33,217
Your escort is coming for you.

270
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:36,717
I must hand you over to them and
have no choice in the matter.

271
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:39,624
I'd like to say a few
words before that happens.

272
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:42,880
Disciple Eugeo,

273
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:46,735
breaking that seal is something
I was never able to do.

274
00:20:47,040 --> 00:20:50,393
And as a result, you should
be able to go where I cannot.

275
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:54,420
Have faith in your sword
and in your friend.

276
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:59,580
Disciple Kirito, In all
the time you were here,

277
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:02,094
I never got to know who you really are.

278
00:21:02,820 --> 00:21:07,220
That said, I do know everything here
will change once you reach the tower.

279
00:21:08,340 --> 00:21:13,780
Even if I can't help you directly, I'll be
praying that you find the truth. Always.

280
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:44,960
I've seen this kind of blue and
gold somewhere before, but where?

281
00:21:46,820 --> 00:21:51,160
I am the Integrity Knight who
oversees the capital of Senator.

282
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,840
I am Alice.

283
00:22:02,980 --> 00:22:03,860
Sympathis 30.

284
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,820
Let's go.

285
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:29,120
Realize to you?
